    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sarmentīcĭus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		sarmentum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to twigs</i>,
				<i>cuttings</i>, or <i>brushwood</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 26, 3</span></i>
			.— In <i>plur. subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sarmentīcĭi</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the Christians</i>, who were burned with fagots,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 50</span></i>.</div>
